hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-10 : List (List Word)
hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-10 = cons "**An edge is a bare assertion.** In RDF the unit is a triple: subject, predicate, object. In a property graph it is" (cons "a labelled edge with attributes. Either way the edge states that a relation holds and carries nothing that" (cons "establishes it. Provenance can be attached as metadata through reification, named graphs or edge attributes. But" (cons "the metadata isn't the justification. It names a source; it doesn't contain the reasoning. A consumer who wants" (cons "to know why has to leave the graph." (cons "" nil)))))
